59.130Z","creator":{"name":"Chipotle","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":1}},{"id":990566015,"name":"Cursed Islands","desc":"❤️ Use code \"350KLIKES\"! Exclusive code at 400K likes! ❤️\n🔥 Make sure to leave a like and invite your friends to play! 🔥\n\n🌴Welcome to Cursed Islands!🌴\nHop from island to island avoiding disasters. Level up, win coins, rubies, and more! Be the last one standing! \n\n🎒 Choose from 14 Gear Items to help you in-game!\n👕 Over 25 cosmetic items to purchase and equip!\n📻 Purchase dances and taunts to show off to your opponents!\n🏝️ Customise your own island!\n\n🎉 Make sure to hit the follow button for when new Updates drop! 🎉\n\nNEW UPDATE:\n- New Ghost Mode!\n- Bug Fixes!\n- x2 Coins Weekend!\n\n🎮 Brought to you by Voldex! 🎮\n\nTags: Survival, Islands, Party, Party Games, Multiplayer, Fun, Disaster","path":"/game/990566015-cursed-islands","slug":"990566015-cursed-islands","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/5678bcff6b8b9dc8a0056e2016dd8ea55e4120f9fe4943a653686b5d24a55701.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-8f31619ce1484567f11297f047b96dbc/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":5,"visitor":477551704,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-06-14T05:51:32.097Z","creator":{"name":"Cursed Islands by Voldex","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":5874128725,"name":"[EVENT! 🎅🏼🎁] No Jumping Difficulty Chart Obby","desc":"✨ JOIN THE GROUP FOR A FREE \"[GAMER]\" TAG! ✨ (❗ EQUIP USING TITLES BUTTON ❗)\nhttps://www.roblox.com/groups/7594081/No-Jump-Studios\n\nA new difficulty chart... but WITHOUT JUMPING?\nThis obby has fun and unique stages, while still making sure everything is skill related!\nThe game gets more difficult the further you progress. Please don't be put off by the like ratio as players may dislike if they can't complete a stage!\nThis game is a collaboration by Buzzotic and Skytimed.\nWe hope you enjoy the adventure!\n\n⏩ In-game hourly free skips! \n🛒 New Purchasable shop items to help you get through stages!\n🏁 Rebirth for points at the expense of your progress!\n⭐ Buy titles using our new points system!\n✅ Nerfs, revamps and more stages!\n\nThere are currently 234 stages.\n\n🔨 Skytimed, MohoOoPvP, Buzzotic\n📜 7z99\nContributors: Chiefdoom, MxtzL, GuyAwesomest\n\ndifficulty chart obby, dco, parkour, no jump obby, adventure, easy, hard, rage, obby, stages","path":"/game/5874128725-no-jumping-difficulty-chart-obby","slug":"5874128725-no-jumping-difficulty-chart-obby","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/5888235baabcc6f84333fa9d72ac6a8b9f35648f84db6b5b22f0f03c48d3732c.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-a3de46b0560178b1c10bedc4769739f3/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":5,"visitor":296599348,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2021-12-06T04:11:28.388Z","creator":{"name":"No Jump Studios","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":4375458071,"name":"Elemental Grind Game","desc":"I decided to remake an old game","path":"/game/4375458071-elemental-grind-game","slug":"4375458071-elemental-grind-game","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/006e6102ccd50b282bd4378e5e734eaabeeb3191c9ea4dbf74aad4467c90524b.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-5873f125a229ea4f86821af54377d330/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":5,"visitor":27838699,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-05-18T22:52:22.828Z","creator":{"name":"rentabean","type":"User"},"script":{"count":4,"freeCount":4,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":1}},{"id":6924952561,"name":"Clover City","desc":"Join the group for a permanent glowstick item!\r\n\r\nWarning: This game is difficult.\r\n\r\nAccount must be at least 2 weeks old to play!\r\n\r\n💸You can get money by robbing Safes, killing NPCs or getting a job.\r\n💥Most small structures like the streetlights, fire hydrants, and trees can be damaged with any gun or melee.\r\n🪓You can gather wood from the fallen trees and use to barricade certain places\r\n🏠Customize and build your own home\r\n💪Get bigger or smaller at the gym\r\n🕵Explore and discover secrets\r\n\r\nBasic Controls:\r\nHold down to charge your melee attacks.  Max damage when the fist glows.\r\nE, Stomp | G, Carry | Q Mouselock (must have mouselock active)\r\nF, Block | Ctrl, Crouch | Shift, Run\r\n\r\nGreen bar is your health.  Yellow bar is your stamina.\r\n💫Means you're knocked out, stomping someone knocked out will damage them\r\n⚠️Means you're down, stomping someone down will kill them\r\n☠️Means you're dead\r\n\r\nGame similar to Da Hood, Criminality and aspects of Ohio.","path":"/game/6924952561-clover-city","slug":"6924952561-clover-city","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/96521d8e815b5576e5799b810ad597e0c9ecd1f89b919818f94bc6098d36c50e.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-815d523621d80c52f4d001e87698e398/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":5,"visitor":15646293,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2023-08-18T17:56:59.691Z","creator":{"name":"Digital Cosmos","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":2,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":8426538932,"name":"Elite Zombie Lab","desc":"🧪 Create a cure for the zombies as a scientist! \n🧟‍♀️ Infect scientists as a zombie and escape the facility! \n🔐 Uncover the secrets of the facility! \n\n👍 Like & Favorite for new content, and exclusive outfits!\n\n📋 CHANGELOG \nv. 6.9.12\nAdded NPC Zombies that you can sample and cure\nAdded PlagueDoctor outfit\n\nv. 6.9.7\nAdded Daily Rewards that you can claim to unlock exclusive weapons!\nAdded inventory sorting after equips/re-equips\n\nv. 6.9.5\nAdded a Stats Menu to look at all your stats\nAdded a cool effect when you get coins\nYou now get coins for being sampled or fixing barricades.\nIncreased the amount of coins you get from everything\n\n🏗️ Builder - @Exbium \n📜 Scripter - @Navillion \n\n🔱 Join The Group: https://www.roblox.com/groups/7802405/Studio-Nex","path":"/game/8426538932-elite-zombie-lab","slug":"84265389